        </a>
        <a href="/en/non-muslim-divorce-uae/" class="service-link">
          <strong>Non-Muslim Divorce</strong>
          <span>The civil route for expats</span>
        </a>
      </div>
    </section>

    <FAQSection items={faqItems} lang="en" />

    <section class="section section--cta" aria-labelledby="bottom-cta-heading" id="contact">
      <h2 id="bottom-cta-heading">Talaq Given? Ask Before the Iddah Ends</h2>
      <p>Request a free, confidential consultation with a UAE-licensed family lawyer, in English or Arabic, to check where you stand: which talaq this is in law, how much of the iddah is left, and how to register a ruju or respond to one. For a religious question, a qualified scholar is the right person to ask.</p>
      <LeadForm lang="en" variant="inline" />
    </section>

  </main>

